LLM Response:
-----------------------------------------------------------
Text:
A CBP competency score reflects your performance in the assessments associated with a Competency Building Product (CBP). CBPs are designed to help government officials enhance or acquire competencies (Attitudes, Skills, and Knowledge). Passing the assessments within a CBP with the minimum required score allows you to acquire the competency and add it to your competency list. Your score contributes to your Total Competency Score (TCS).

