A CBP competency score is awarded upon completing a Competency Building Product (CBP) and its related assessments. This score directly reflects your performance on those assessments. CBPs include resources, courses, modules, and programs that government officials can use to enhance or acquire competencies. Competencies are defined as a combination of Attitudes, Skills, and Knowledge (ASK).
